The Chat | Terminal switch in mods/omarchy-pane/main.js (chatty, chatOf, agentOf, parked, app,
the toggle loop, toChat, toTerminal and closeChat) is adapted from Shepherdr's pane-chat mod,
and mods/omarchy-agents/parked.js, mods/omarchy-agents/sweep.js and mods/omarchy-spaces/parked.js
from Shepherdr's lib/parked.js, https://github.com/eliasstravik/shepherdr, under the MIT License
below. Changes: omarchy's square look and rounded header corners, native notifications instead of
Shepherdr's toasts, no Autopilot parts, and the lists passed in as arguments. In
mods/omarchy-pane/assistant.js, slotOf follows pane-chat's lazySlot and isAssistant follows
Shepherdr's lib/coordinator.js isCoordinator; the start itself is left to Shepherdr's chat mod.

